00:20:52.550 --> 00:20:54.940
I can see

00:20:55.420 --> 00:21:00.280
all the nasty stuff under that mask of yours.

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:04.570
Good luck...

00:21:15.270 --> 00:21:17.540
Yes, who is it?

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:22.880
Hello?

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:29.470
Uh... Handout... I came to bring... 
a handout to Sae— To Nanako-san!

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:32.130
Oh, thank you very much.

00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:33.350
Please wait one moment.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:35.520
Yes, excuse me!

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:37.930
Excuse me...

00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:25.100
She said you were crying last night.

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:27.470
We agreed to take things slow, right?

00:23:25.600 --> 00:23:28.370
I'm adding to my list of sins...

00:23:26.970 --> 00:23:29.130
Well? Dropped your mask some?

00:23:28.600 --> 00:23:31.020
The others will find out!

00:23:28.600 --> 00:23:32.110
If you're hiding anything from me, tell me now.

00:23:32.110 --> 00:23:33.250
I believe you.

00:23:32.290 --> 00:23:34.450
You're the only one I can turn to...

00:23:34.450 --> 00:23:36.060
Goodbye.

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:40.960
<b>The next one will be better. 
